---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<section>
  <div
    class="mx-auto max-w-7xl border-y border-neutral-200 px-10 py-18 sm:font-light"
  >
    <div class="body-text text-left sm:text-2xl">
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-balance">
        Your customers want fast and
        <b>
          instant access to helpful resources, but support requests keep piling
          up and your team is stretched thin.
        </b>
        Repetitive questions and slow response times add friction.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed"></p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex items-start gap-2 sm:items-center">
        <p class="leading-relaxed">
          <Image
            src={"https://assets.padyna.com/assets/padyna-official-logo.png"}
            alt="Padyna logo"
            class="inline h-7 w-7 rotate-3 rounded-lg shadow-sm sm:-mt-1.5 sm:mr-2"
            width={28}
            height={28}
            loading="lazy"
            fetchpriority="high"
          />{" "}
          <b>Padyna</b> gives you a smarter customer support experience with
          <b>clear answers, faster resolution, and fewer tickets</b> so your team
          can focus on what matters most.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
